div data-controller="clipboard"
  button.cursor-pointer.rounded-md.border.border-slate-200.bg-slate-100.px-3.py-1.5.font-mono.text-sm type="button" title="Click to copy" data-action="clipboard#copy"
    code data-clipboard-target="source"= password
  span.ml-2.text-xs.text-green-700 hidden=true data-clipboard-target="feedback" Copied!
  p.mt-2.text-xs.text-slate-500 Shown only once — copy it now. It cannot be recovered, only regenerated.
